m 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 42 of those years. In 2025, November to December ran 50% of normal on the middle, and 2026 opened with January to February at 45%. Grid 16352 had its driest year in 1954 at 62% of normal.</p>"}
